# Phase 1 Pages feature — database, password hashing, signed session cookies.
# We dropped passlib: passlib 1.7.4 has a compat bug with bcrypt >=5 ("detect
# wrap bug" raises on import) and there's no 1.7.5 release. The auth module
# now calls bcrypt directly, which works on bcrypt 4.x and 5.x.
# Capped below 2.1 on 2026-09-24. SQLAlchemy 2.1 switched the default
# Postgres driver to psycopg 3 and broke a fresh Render build; app/db.py
# now names psycopg2 explicitly, and 2.0.x is the line every test ran
# on. Raise the cap only after the app is tested on 2.1.
